.TH tkdateentry n 0.29.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkdateentry \- date entry with calendar picker
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkdateentry
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkdateentry::widget .d]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Entry showing a date plus a drop-down month grid of day buttons (Monday-first)
with prev/next navigation, Today and Clear. Display uses \-dateformat; getDate
returns the ISO date. See docs/tkdateentry.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tkutils::tkcal(n), tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, date, calendar
